{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"元朗光榮冰室不潔屢次違例　遭食環署釘牌\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/FEHD-CLOSE-261109-20.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】元朗光榮冰室因食物室不潔，以及未有妥善維修衞生設備，屢次違反《食物業規例》，被食環署取消牌照，冰室需即時停業。</p><p>元朗光榮冰室位於康樂路兆明樓地下，落半閘並無營業，地下有蟑螂和老鼠籠。食環署指，光榮冰室因為違例事項，八月時八次被法庭定罪，共罰款四千元。</p><p>署方亦根據違例記分制，記下食肆持牌人65分，因此取消其牌照。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T13:03:34.738524+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T12:17:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.088592+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T12:57:23.180445+00:00","content_hash":"e115bdb4e78174c78d438d2baec3b2e829bd74c443acd40870ee31cc57bfcd02","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T13:03:34.738524+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}